%% UX / server responsibilities are labelled. API keys are relative to /api. Policy and runtime evidence remain unapproved.
flowchart TD
    Filters["Quick filters: All / Blocked Only / My Tasks; permitted cards only; no matches shows empty result"]
    Start["Open board; server checks session and project membership"]
    Active{"Active Sprint exists? At most one"}
    Empty["No active sprint; planning link only with Sprint-management capability"]
    Board["Render To Do / In Progress / Done; permitted task cards"]
    Action{"Choose action"}
    Capability{"Current scoped action capability?"}
    Readonly["Viewer/stakeholder default: Read-only view; server also enforces"]
    Move["Direct move between any columns, including reopen Done; POST /tasks/{task_id}/state"]
    Block["Flag or resolve: POST /tasks/{task_id}/blockers; status open or resolved; description, optional outcome"]
    Server["Server validates session, membership, capability, input, expected revision and idempotency"]
    Saved["Confirmed state; reopened completed-Sprint task returns to Backlog as To Do; Sprint history retained; blockers use committed sequence"]
    Conflict["409: rollback optimistic display; fetch latest permitted state"]
    Failure["400: correct input; network/503: rollback, reconcile before retry; never claim saved"]
    Loss["401: sign-in; membership loss: clear protected board and generic 404; cancel pending UI"]
    Link["Linked source: shared protected-read flow; project-shared OR restricted plus grant; exact version rules"]
    Doc["Show exact permitted document"]
    Hidden["Generic 404; no metadata"]
    AI["Event: AI outage alone leaves Workspace operations available"]
    Start -->|Permitted| Active
    Start -->|Denied / expired| Loss
    Active -->|No| Empty
    Active -->|Yes| Board
    Board --> Filters
    Action -->|State / blocker action| Capability
    Capability -->|No| Readonly
    Capability -->|State action allowed| Move
    Capability -->|Blocker action allowed| Block
    Move --> Server
    Block --> Server
    Server -->|Confirmed| Saved
    Server -->|409| Conflict
    Server -->|Invalid / unavailable| Failure
    Server -->|Session / access lost| Loss
    Action -->|Open linked source| Link
    Link -->|Permitted| Doc
    Link -->|Unknown / denied| Hidden
    Link -->|Authority / service error| Failure
    Board -->|Removal detected on refresh / update| Loss
    AI -->|Own dependencies healthy| Board
    Filters -->|Choose filter or keep All| Action
